{"ID":"20230926142129-shl4quj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926142129-shl4quj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142129-shl4quj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142132-697zw7c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142132-yd108v7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142132-yd108v7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:43,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:43\u0026#125;","title":"【甘草麻黄汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926142132"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926142132-697zw7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926142132-697zw7c","updated":"20230926142132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：甘草二两、麻黄四两"}]},{"ID":"20230926142132-uebk6nl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926142132-uebk6nl","updated":"20230926142132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上二味，以水五升，先煮麻黄，去上沫，纳甘草，煮取三升，去滓，温服一升，复令汗出，不汗再服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926142132-yd108v7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926142132-yd108v7","updated":"20230926142132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【14.64】里水，一身面目黄肿，其脉沉，小便不利，甘草麻黄汤主之；越婢加术汤亦主之。"}]}]}